# BUN-GA-RUA: Space past the intro, then LEFT (= English) and Space on the title,
# repeated over a window so it lands whatever the boot time. In the stage, walk
# LEFT (the stage scrolls that way and the flame enemies come) and punch (Space).
14s   SPACE 5 every 100 until 30s
32s   LEFT  5 every 100 until 44s
33s   SPACE 5 every 100 until 45s
48s   LEFT  400
50s   SPACE 5 every 25 until 70s
